Merchant Transactions Platform
A FastAPI backend where merchants can:

create payment intents
confirm/capture payments
issue refunds
receive webhook notifications
inspect transaction history
view balances from ledger postings
optionally flag suspicious transactions for review
That feels:

specific enough for Stripe
general enough for Dropbox
backend-heavy enough for both

What should be core vs optional
Core
    FastAPI async API
    PostgreSQL
    payment intent lifecycle
    refunds
    idempotency keys
    immutable ledger entries
    webhook delivery with retries
    structured logging
    tests
    Docker
    Secondary but valuable
    Redis caching / dedupe
    background workers
    reconciliation job
    basic risk rules
    admin replay of failed webhooks
    metrics / tracing

Optional
    manual review queue
    dispute simulation
    payout scheduling
    internal gRPC service